{"blocks":[["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-125","Adds a locator to the Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement View/Scrub Area at the play position during playback or recording; with the transport stopped, at the insert marker or the start of the time selection.",["Set Locator button"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-334","When a locator is selected, the button becomes the Delete Locator button.",["Set Locator button"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-411","Behavior — trigger. New locators are quantized to the global launch quantization.",["Set Locator button"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-502","Remote control — MIDI or key mapping. Ableton/Manual/06/03 Launching the Arrangement with Locators keeps a suggested key for it.",["Set Locator button"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-644","Source",["Set Locator button"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-657","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View",["Set Locator button","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Button/Set%20Locator/","source-block-701","Ableton/Live/UG/06 Arrangement View/04 Launching the Arrangement with Locators · 6.4 Launching the Arrangement with Locators",["Set Locator button","Source"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Insert%20Marker/","source-block-102","Insert marker",[]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Insert%20Marker/","source-block-120","The flashing blue marker on a track where playback starts. Click in a track to move it; double-click the Ableton/Live/UI/Control Bar/Button/Stop or press Home (Win) / Fn+Left (Mac) to return it to the start.",["Insert marker"]],["Ableton/Live/UI/Arrangement%20View/Marker/Insert%20Marker/","source-block-335","Moves with the Ableton/Live/UI/Control Bar/Field/Arrangement Position.",["Insert marker"